# Horizon Forbidden West

**Developer:** Guerrilla Games  
**Release Year:** 2022  
**Genre:** Action RPG / Open World

## Overview
Aloy returns in a vast new frontier filled with robotic beasts and ancient secrets. Forbidden West expands the world and mechanics of the original.

## Features
- Underwater exploration and glider traversal
- Enhanced visuals and weather systems
- New machines and combat tools
- Deep story and side quests

## Legacy
A visually stunning sequel that builds on Horizon’s strengths.
